  ]
}
```
**3. Use the `--experimental-modules` flag**

If you're using Node.js 14 or later, you can try running your Vercel function with the `--experimental-modules` flag:
```bash
nodeserver.exp --experimental-modules vercel-server.js
```
This tells Node.js to treat your file as a module. Note that Vercel might still have issues with the `import` statement, so try option 1 or 2 if this doesn't work.

